 Because the next election is within the next 14 days, registering to vote through this website won't allow you to vote in the upcoming election. You can still vote in the upcoming election but you will need to take additional steps. Here’s how: [Registering to Vote within 14 Days of Election](https://mvic.sos.state.mi.us/Home/RegisterToVote/#how)

# What's on the ballot?

 This page will show you a sample ballot for **_any precinct_** in the State for the upcoming election. You can view **_your own_** sample ballot by checking the [voter information section of this website](https://mvic.sos.state.mi.us/Voter/Index).   
  

  
  

## View ballot by county, jurisdiction and precinct

Required fields are marked with an asterisk *.

